<title>UK: CITIBANK RAISES UK BASE RATE TO 7.0 PCT.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK RAISES UK BASE RATE TO 7.0 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank said on Thursday it had raised its sterling base rate to 7.0 percent from 6.75 percent with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The move follows a 1/4 point rise in official UK interest rates announced earlier on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
